{
  "title": "Marco Polo",
  "hook_type": "warning",
  "cards": [
    {
      "text": "Never answer \"Polo\" in a lake at night.",
      "scene": "forest",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553183027-02458215d51c?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "NifTl3qB6No",
      "photo_credit": "vk22 Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "My best friend called \"Marco\" from the black water, and I answered.",
      "scene": "window",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1629193266680-9193cc4a0c81?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "DHzJKAfeKFM",
      "photo_credit": "Daniel Olah"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then I heard her laughing on the jetty behind me, towelling off.",
      "scene": "door",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512420827232-659ecb709157?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "5SvkUck2MTg",
      "photo_credit": "David Torres"
    },
    {
      "text": "Out on the lake, her voice called \"Marco\" again. Closer.",
      "scene": "forest",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1642345968553-9a0df24117b7?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "G9MLgEFoQm4",
      "photo_credit": "Esten Erbol"
    },
    {
      "text": "I stayed silent. Something slid past my legs, slow, feeling for me.",
      "scene": "hallway",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611165079922-f6cd7c4bd368?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "qVonFgrDVdc",
      "photo_credit": "william f. santos"
    },
    {
      "text": "I swam for the jetty, and she hauled me out by my wrists.",
      "scene": "door",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1604242937846-138611917a44?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "6vHGBZ2A5Rc",
      "photo_credit": "Miguel Bandeira"
    },
    {
      "text": "Laughing, she called \"Marco\" at the water, just to prove it was nothing.",
      "scene": "house",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580416534792-b0aa855bd054?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "SR5sB1wsG1U",
      "photo_credit": "Chris Barrett"
    },
    {
      "text": "The lake answered \"Polo\". In my voice.",
      "scene": "dark",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515311320503-6e3d309537b4?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "JPdapbV4C6Q",
      "photo_credit": "Jordan Steranka"
    }
  ],
